 "headline": "<strong>\"SUCH A FUN ACTIVATION STEPPING INTO THE WORLD OF ADULTS\" </strong><em>- </em><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/pilarscratch/\"><em>Pilarscratch</em></a>",
 "intro": "WE CREATED A BODEGA AND SPEAKEASY IN NEW YORK CITY TO CELEBRATE THE LAUNCH OF <em>Adults</em>  SEASON 2 FOR FX.",
