   ],
   "html": "<p>For one weekend in the Lower East Side, guests walked into the world of <em>Adults</em> via The Munchie Mart. Our bodega-inspired pop-up mirrored an episode arc straight from the show’s universe: you arrive, get pulled in, things get weird, you end up somewhere unexpected, and you leave with a story.</p>\n<p>A private VIP party kicked off the weekend, with a table read featuring the cast and hosted by show creators <strong>Ben Kronengold</strong> and <strong>Rebecca Shaw</strong> and a DJ spinning tracks all night long, while consumer days followed featuring giveaways and surprise programming for fans.</p>"
  }
 ],
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "VIP NIGHT",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>A special VIP preview party kicked off the Munchie Mart with loads of entertainment including a live script reading featuring the full cast, a DJ set by <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/lil2hood_/\"><strong>Lil2hood</strong></a>, 100+ VIP guests, creators, and media, plus an open bar and food from Prince Street and Pop-Up Bagels.</p>"
