  {
   "title": "Creator day",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>For the <strong><em>Adults </em>Munchie Mart in NY,</strong> IHC Digital managed guest list logistics and invited creators to the VIP preview and table read. Additionally, we produced a full <strong>creator junket </strong>that included <strong>13 creators </strong>and <strong>1 press invite</strong>. Of the 13 creators, <strong>10 were paid creators</strong> and <strong>3 earned.</strong></p>"
    },
