  {
   "title": "THE BODEGA",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>We transformed the iconic Arlene’s Grocery into an Adults-themed Munchie Mart giving guests a bodega experience, complete with eccentric decor, branded shelves, and a fully outfitted checkout counter. In the back of the mart, a secret door transported guests into a cooler and through a dark corridor before entering the speakeasy hidden within.</p>"
    },
