  {
   "title": "THE SPEAKEASY",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>Guests entered the speaeasy straight onto the stage and into the action. The dark, late night hangout featured themed mocktails, slushies, rotating programming, and in-world branding. The stage was decorated to feel warm and cozy with a little chaos, straight out of an <em>Adults episode</em>. Comfortable couches and chairs were placed to host an array of rotating comedians and DJs throughout the night. </p>"
