  {
   "title": "Vibes & Decor",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>Each guest received custom branded buttons and a scratch off ticket with winning tickets revealing intentionally ridiculous bodega staples. Guests were able to order a complimentary slice of pizza from Prince Street. Custom mocktails and a branded slushie station offered guests a complimentary refresher.</p>"
