  {
   "title": "photo moments",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>The branded product shelf featured an appearance from our hyper-realistic raccoon tucked among the goods providing a photo moment for anyone who encountered the unexpected visitor. On the way into the speakeasy, guests were encouraged to take selfies in the oversized security mirror. Additionally, guests could pose with their friends in the branded photobooth, creating a fun keepsake inspired by the new season.</p>"
