  {
   "title": "THE STOOP SALE",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>For the <em>Adults</em><strong> </strong>Stoop Sale at the <a href=\"https://melrosetradingpost.org/\"><strong>Melrose Trading Post</strong></a><strong> </strong>in LA, we invited earned creators to attend the one day activation. The lineup included 3 paid creators who contributed story posts, plus 1 paid LA based creator who joined the <em>Adults</em> fashion conversation.</p>"
    },
    {
     "type": "gallery",
     "media": [
      {
       "type": "image",
       "src": "/images/6ae1180cbcd35412bb18a536_houseofcostura-story-4.avif",
       "alt": ""
      },
